    {
        "text": "You did not see how Saria moved. All you know is that she was standing in front of you before you knew it."
    },
    {
        "text": "You know she never carries a Rhine-made shield on the streets of Columbia."
    },
    {
        "text": "She turns herself into a shield."
    },
    {
        "text": "The enamel barrier growing from her crossed forearms blocks the power armor's attack."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_532_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "middle",
