    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.1
    },
    {
        "text": "You hear Saria mutter under her breath."
    },
    {
        "text": "That is how she views such rogue Columbian technology."
    },
    {
        "text": "Her expression tells you what her next move is."
    },
    {
        "text": "Saria wastes no time dealing with pests."
    },
    {
        "text": "Her hand closes upon the chest of the power armor, where a dark hole would soon appear."
    },
    {
        "text": "The power armor would be destroyed, or more aptly, die."
    },
    {
        "text": "A thought comes to your mind."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.1,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Saria, no!",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "She may or may not have heard more than the first syllable, but she does, in fact, stop."
    },
    {
        "text": "It is the result of trust that you have accumulated over the course of many battles."
    },
    {
