    {
        "text": "Her fist only scrapes the core, but the shockwave is enough to shatter the power armor's outer shell."
    },
    {
        "text": "You see something amongst the flying metal shards that looks different."
    },
    {
        "text": "It looks like... strands of hair."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor! Look ou\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mechanist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_532_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's...",
