    {
        "text": "The power armor tips over."
    },
    {
        "text": "As it further disintegrates, you see more hair, then a speck of skin, then an eye."
    },
    {
        "text": "The eye is looking at you."
    },
    {
        "text": "You see many emotions flash across it: anger, fear, bewilderment..."
    },
    {
        "text": "As the shell falls away completely, you realize it is begging for help."
    },
    {
        "text": "You extend your hand."
    },
    {
