    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's happening, Myers?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I don't know, sir...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let Doc Moore go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doc...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_128_plosis_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ptilopsis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Disobeying a direct order?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are you on their side, sir?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't you say we needed to harden our hearts and do what we had to do? Didn't you say we were just their test subjects?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "This was all your idea. I... I liked Doc Moore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never thought you'd be the one to turn against me first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sam, maybe, or somebody else... but you, Myers, you always listened to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "To a fault, you said.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "I listened to my boss at the plant and ended up with Oripathy. Then I started listening to you when I got here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're all smart, got an education. Figured I couldn't go wrong listening to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "But now... we're all gonna die.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "The whitecoats are gonna kill us, Sonny! They think they got it all under control!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Search her if you don't believe me. I'm damned sure she's got a voice recorder on her. She's here to log us, and the silver monsters.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Urbica, if you know a way out of this, it's time to get talking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Elena...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Olivia, I may not have told you the details of the experiment...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I'll never lie to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never lied to you either, Sonny, Myers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I don't know how to deal with them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I studied them and recorded their behavior because I wanted to solve the problem we're facing... like I said, it's part of my job.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think Elena's telling the truth, Myers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "text": "Would you give Joyce back to us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ha... haha....",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Pioneer stares at Ptilopsis. Suddenly, he raises his hand."
    },
    {
        "text": "Silence lets out a mute cry. Her drone rams the Pioneer, sensing its master's will."
    },
    {
        "text": "But all he did was take something from Ptilopsis's hand."
    },
    {
        "text": "It was the treatment band that he put on her only a few hours ago."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_128_plosis_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ptilopsis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What... what have I done...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doc Moore...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "You regret it, huh? The kindness you showed me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone like me doesn't deserve kindness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "The doctor returns to the side of her friends, still quiet, beautiful, pristine."
    },
    {
        "text": "But there is no way out. This lab is a tomb, built specially for them."
    },
    {
        "text": "There is no hope. The band is like a handcuff the company has shackled them with."
    },
    {
        "text": "They will never find freedom, unless..."
    },
    {
        "text": "The Pioneer stuffs the medical wristband into his mouth."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Myers!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "S-Sir...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you doing! Spit it out, now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The band...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It contains multiple doses of painkillers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "His heart can't possibly take it. It'll kill him!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've seen guys swallow these...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're all dead!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The dead are the lucky ones...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Spit it out, damn you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll hold his jaw. Sock him in the stomach, Sam!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
