        "power": 5,
        "times": 2,
        "fadetime": 0.51,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough* *cough*",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "One more time! I see the treatment band!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Olivia, let's help\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Olivia?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Joyce.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_128_plosis_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ptilopsis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Program start.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ptilopsis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's awake?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_128_plosis_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's so dark...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ptilopsis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why is it so dark outside...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ptilopsis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dark? But all the lights are on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "Joyce... are your eyes okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_128_plosis_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$drift_intro",
        "key": "$drift_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "...Light.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ptilopsis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Light... need light... warmth...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ptilopsis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forward...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ptilopsis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fearless...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ptilopsis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you hear us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She can't.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's going on?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know, but none of that sounds like Joyce.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Her condition...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know her. She's never sounded like this, before or after the operation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're surprised. You don't know what's happening to her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "text": "That means the situation has long gone out of your control.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Elena... it's time to talk about these experiments.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did Dorothy...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't want to see anyone get hurt because of our work. Especially not Joyce.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe you're right. We should have worked together to solve the problem.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's ok, Elena. No need to hesitate anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Female Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "I invited all of you here. You have the right to know the truth, both Dr. Silence, and my Pioneer friends.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Female Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You were... spying on us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "I was concerned.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Female Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone needs to close the doors while you stop to talk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Female Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You stopped the silver monsters?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't call them that, Sonny.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Female Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "They can hear you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Female Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Elena, my dear assistant, there's one more thing that I require of you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Female Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bring them to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Female Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "What you don't feel comfortable explaining, I can.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Female Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you know my lab is the safest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Female Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
