        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "No hostiles left outside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greyy"
    },
    {
        "text": "They all followed Mr. Sonny and Dr. Silence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greyy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#6$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Communications are still out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greyy"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like jamming across all standard frequencies. Mechanist might have been able to do something about it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greyy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#4$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who's there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greyy"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Sonny?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greyy"
    },
    {
        "text": "Freeze.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "That voice...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greyy"
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Mary?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greyy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#4$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like you've got a decent memory.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#6$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Why... why are you here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greyy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#6$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Where is he?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#5$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "He... you mean Mr. Sonny?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greyy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#5$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell him to show himself and stop hiding behind a child like a coward!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#6$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Er, I'm a grown man...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greyy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#6$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Just barely.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mary"
    },
    {
        "text": "Out with it, boy. Where are they?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#5$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The Pioneers are in a building nearby...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greyy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#5$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know your ears twitch when you're embarrassed?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#4$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Er... huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greyy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#4$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Just kidding.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mary"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you're a little too trusting, aren't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#4$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This will go a lot easier if you tell me everything you know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mary"
    },
    {
        "text": "Otherwise, since you're the one who fixed the power supply, I can arrest you for obstruction of justice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mary"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I can't catch the real perp, I guess you'll have to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#5$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No, please... don't...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greyy"
    },
    {
        "text": "I-I don't want to cause trouble for the Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greyy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#5$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Then what are you waiting for? Start talking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#6$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not sure if you'll believe me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greyy"
    },
    {
        "text": "We were attacked by a bunch of silver shapeshifters, the likes of which we've never seen before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greyy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
