        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "29_g4_corridor",
        "screenadapt": "showall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
        "name2": "avg_135_halo_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So, she's inside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
        "name2": "avg_135_halo_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. This is Dorothy's lab, and the heart of the complex.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
        "name2": "avg_135_halo_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You sure?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the matter, Sonny?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's wicked stressful, getting so close to the truth.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Remember what I said, Sam. Be ready.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, sir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you open the door, Dr. Urbica?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_135_halo_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Elena.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_135_halo_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(Huh?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_135_halo_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Something feels off with the Pioneers.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(But we've come this far.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "(You convinced me that we're all here to solve the same problem, Olivia.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(I'm not so sure anymore...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Clock's ticking, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Same here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Female Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come in, please.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Female Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Elena's hand never touched the scanner."
    },
    {
        "text": "But the doors of the lab open to the true master of the house."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
